---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy | Trouvus" description="How Trouvus handles information submitted through this website.">
  <Hero eyebrow="Legal" title="Privacy notice." lead="How information is handled on the Trouvus website." variant="network" />
  <section><div class="wrap prose">
    <div class="badge amber">Private-preview draft · legal review required</div>
    <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> August 28, 2026.</p>
    <h2>Information you choose to provide</h2>
    <p>During the private preview, the consultation form does not transmit information to Trouvus or store it on the website. Submitting the form opens a prepared message in your own email application. Information you then send by email is used to respond to your enquiry and assess whether Trouvus can assist.</p>
    <h2>Technical information</h2>
    <p>The hosting provider may process limited technical data—such as IP address, browser information and request logs—to deliver and secure the website. Trouvus does not currently use advertising cookies or sell personal information.</p>
    <h2>Retention and disclosure</h2>
    <p>Enquiry information is retained only as long as reasonably necessary for business, legal and security purposes. It may be shared with service providers that support communications or professional operations, subject to appropriate safeguards, or where required by law.</p>
    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>You may ask to access, correct or delete personal information held by Trouvus, subject to applicable law. Contact <a href="mailto:info@trouvus.com">info@trouvus.com</a>.</p>
    <h2>Before public launch</h2>
    <p>This notice must be updated when analytics, consent management or a CRM-backed form is enabled, and reviewed for compliance with applicable Canadian and international privacy requirements.</p>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>
